From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] taskpanel: one icon style for hide keyboard, back and close
Description:
 The right button of the navigation panel showed the thin go-down-symbolic
 and go-previous-symbolic icons from breeze-icons next to the bold
 mobile-close-app and mobile-task-switcher icons. Draw mobile-hide-keyboard,
 mobile-go-back and mobile-close-window in one style (12px grid, open strokes
 with round caps, stroke width 1.4, slightly heavier than the task switcher
 outline because diagonal strokes look lighter), carried as resources of the
 applet, and use them for the three states of the button. The close icon has
 its own name: the icon loader takes an icon of the theme with the file name
 of a resource path in place of the resource.
 .
 The icons belong to breeze-icons next to the other mobile-* icons; until
 then the applet carries them.
Forwarded: no
License: GPL-2.0-or-later (as the patched files; new icons LGPL-2.1-or-later)
Last-Update: 2026-11-27
---
 containments/taskpanel/CMakeLists.txt                 |  8 ++++++++
 containments/taskpanel/icons/mobile-close-window.svg  | 11 +++++++++++
 containments/taskpanel/icons/mobile-go-back.svg       | 11 +++++++++++
 containments/taskpanel/icons/mobile-hide-keyboard.svg | 11 +++++++++++
 .../taskpanel/qml/NavigationPanelComponent.qml        |  9 ++++++---
 5 files changed, 47 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 containments/taskpanel/icons/mobile-close-window.svg
 create mode 100644 containments/taskpanel/icons/mobile-go-back.svg
 create mode 100644 containments/taskpanel/icons/mobile-hide-keyboard.svg

diff --git a/containments/taskpanel/CMakeLists.txt b/containments/taskpanel/CMakeLists.txt
index b00404f4d..1db115e2e 100644
--- a/containments/taskpanel/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/containments/taskpanel/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -12,6 +12,14 @@ plasma_add_applet(org.kde.plasma.mobile.taskpanel
         taskpanel.cpp
 )
 
+qt_add_resources(org.kde.plasma.mobile.taskpanel "taskpanel_icons"
+    PREFIX "/org/kde/plasma/mobile/taskpanel"
+    FILES
+        icons/mobile-close-window.svg
+        icons/mobile-go-back.svg
+        icons/mobile-hide-keyboard.svg
+)
+
 target_link_libraries(org.kde.plasma.mobile.taskpanel PRIVATE
                       Qt::Gui
                       Qt::DBus
